{
    "title": "Partiful: Fun Party Invites",
    "description": "ACTUALLY FUN EVENT PAGES\r\n\r\n- Create pages for any event \u2014 birthdays, pregames, kickbacks, dinners, game nights, group trips, and more\r\n- Make it aesthetic with page themes, effects, and event posters\r\n- Guests can see who else is going and add comments, GIFs, and photos to the page\r\n\r\nINVITE FRIENDS FROM ANYWHERE\r\n\r\n- Customize your RSVP settings for all types of events, public or private\r\n- Invite anyone with a link \u2014 guests don\u2019t need the app\r\n- Reuse your guest lists for future events, and invite people you meet at other Partiful parties\r\n\r\nSHARE UPDATES AND PHOTOS\r\n\r\n- Text blast your guests with important updates\r\n- Post comments on the page that guests can react and reply to\r\n- Upload pics to the Photo Roll (guests can add too!)\r\n\r\nFIND A TIME THAT WORKS FOR EVERYONE\r\n\r\n- Not sure who\u2019s free? Poll your guests before selecting a final date\r\n- Guests can RSVP to multiple options, and you pick what works best\r\n- Everyone\u2019s RSVP is automatically updated once you pick a date\r\n\r\nBE TYPE-A ABOUT IT\r\n\r\n- Drop your Venmo or CashApp for guests to chip in\r\n- Limit spots available, we\u2019ll handle the waitlist\r\n- Add a questionnaire to collect dietary restrictions, location preferences, and more\r\n\r\nOR BE CHILL\r\n\r\n- Create a simple page in *seconds* (literally)\r\n- Leave date & time TBD, figure out details later\r\n- Keep it casual with designs for board game nights, dinners, and dates\r\n\r\nKEEP TRACK OF YOUR SOCIAL LIFE\r\n\r\n- View events you\u2019re planning and attending in one place\r\n- Automatically add all Partiful events to your Google, Apple, or Outlook calendar\r\n- Check the guest lists to see who\u2019s coming\r\n- Discover Open Invite events hosted by your Mutuals\r\n\r\nPARTY PROFILES\r\n\r\n- Add a bio, profile photo, and your socials\r\n- Show off how many events you\u2019ve hosted and attended\r\n- Keep track of your Mutuals (the people you\u2019ve partied with)\r\n\r\n\u2026\u2026\r\n\r\nGot questions, suggestions, or fun party ideas? DM us on IG @partiful or email us at hello@partiful.com :)\r\n\r\nFollow us on TikTok, Instagram, and Twitter @partiful",
    "descriptionHTML": "ACTUALLY FUN EVENT PAGES<br><br>- Create pages for any event \u2014 birthdays, pregames, kickbacks, dinners, game nights, group trips, and more<br>- Make it aesthetic with page themes, effects, and event posters<br>- Guests can see who else is going and add comments, GIFs, and photos to the page<br><br>INVITE FRIENDS FROM ANYWHERE<br><br>- Customize your RSVP settings for all types of events, public or private<br>- Invite anyone with a link \u2014 guests don\u2019t need the app<br>- Reuse your guest lists for future events, and invite people you meet at other Partiful parties<br><br>SHARE UPDATES AND PHOTOS<br><br>- Text blast your guests with important updates<br>- Post comments on the page that guests can react and reply to<br>- Upload pics to the Photo Roll (guests can add too!)<br><br>FIND A TIME THAT WORKS FOR EVERYONE<br><br>- Not sure who\u2019s free? Poll your guests before selecting a final date<br>- Guests can RSVP to multiple options, and you pick what works best<br>- Everyone\u2019s RSVP is automatically updated once you pick a date<br><br>BE TYPE-A ABOUT IT<br><br>- Drop your Venmo or CashApp for guests to chip in<br>- Limit spots available, we\u2019ll handle the waitlist<br>- Add a questionnaire to collect dietary restrictions, location preferences, and more<br><br>OR BE CHILL<br><br>- Create a simple page in *seconds* (literally)<br>- Leave date &amp; time TBD, figure out details later<br>- Keep it casual with designs for board game nights, dinners, and dates<br><br>KEEP TRACK OF YOUR SOCIAL LIFE<br><br>- View events you\u2019re planning and attending in one place<br>- Automatically add all Partiful events to your Google, Apple, or Outlook calendar<br>- Check the guest lists to see who\u2019s coming<br>- Discover Open Invite events hosted by your Mutuals<br><br>PARTY PROFILES<br><br>- Add a bio, profile photo, and your socials<br>- Show off how many events you\u2019ve hosted and attended<br>- Keep track of your Mutuals (the people you\u2019ve partied with)<br><br>\u2026\u2026<br><br>Got questions, suggestions, or fun party ideas? DM us on IG @partiful or email us at hello@partiful.com :)<br><br>Follow us on TikTok, Instagram, and Twitter @partiful",
